1. e3 e5 2. Nc3 d5 3. d4 e4 { Close the centre } 4. Bb5+?! c6 5. Be2 Bd6 6. Bg4 f5 7. Bh5+ g6 8. Be2 Nf6 9. Nh3 O-O 10. Ng5 (10. O-O h6 11. a3 g5 12. b3 f4 13. exf4 Bxh3 14. gxh3 gxf4) 10... h6 11. Ne6 Bxe6 12. f3 { Offers to open up the centre } 12... exf3 { Open up the centre because black is up in material and development which helps black attack faster. } 13. Bxf3 Ne4 14. Bxe4 fxe4 { Prevent white from castling } { [%cal Gf8f1] } 15. Rf1 Qh4+ 16. g3 Rxf1+ { Draws white king closer to kingside to exposed/weakened it even more. } 17. Kxf1 Qxh2 18. Ke1 Bxg3+ 19. Kf1 { [%csl Gf2,Gh3][%cal Gh2f2,Ge6h3] } 19... Bh3# *


