1. e4 d6 2. d4 e6 3. c4 Bd7 4. Nc3 Nf6 5. Nf3 Be7 6. Bd3 O-O 7. O-O c5 8. dxc5 { Taking to avoid central tension } 8... dxc5 9. e5 Nh5 (9... Ne8 { [%cal Gd3h7] } 10. Qe2 Nc6 (10... Bc6 { [%csl Ge4][%cal Gc6e4] } 11. Rd1 { [%cal Gd1d8,Gd3h7] } 11... Qb6 12. Ng5 { [%cal Ge2h5] }) 11. Qe4 { [%cal Ge4h7] } 11... g6 12. Bh6 Ng7) 10. g4 { Breaking principles to win the trapped knight since black cannot exploit the weakness by white pushing the pawn } 10... Nf6 11. exf6 Bxf6 12. g5 Bd4 13. Nxd4 cxd4 14. Ne4 Bc6 15. Qh5 Nd7 { Bringing more pieces to black's kingside to start an attack. } { [%cal Ge4f6,Gd3h7,Gh5h7] } 16. Nf6+ Nxf6 17. gxf6 g6 18. Qh4 { [%cal Gh4f6] } 18... Rc8 19. Bg5 { [%cal Gg5f6] } 19... b5 (19... h5 { [%csl Gf6][%cal Gg5d8] } 20. Bxg6 fxg6 21. f7+) 20. Qh6 Qxf6 21. Bxf6 { Black resign } *


