1. e4 d5 2. exd5 Qxd5 3. Nc3 Qd8 4. d4 { Occupying the centre } 4... Nc6 5. Nf3 Nf6? 6. d5 { Violate principles to punish the fact that black has not push a single pawn in the centre } 6... Nxd5 (6... Nb4 7. Bc4 { [%cal Gc4d5] } 7... Bf5 { [%cal Gb4c2,Gf5c2] } 8. Bb3 (8. Nd4 Bg6 9. O-O Nbxd5 10. Nxd5 Nxd5 11. Bb5+ c6 12. Nxc6 bxc6 13. Bxc6+ Qd7 14. Bxd7+ Kxd7 15. Qxd5+ { [%cal Gd5a8] })) 7. Nxd5 Bg4 8. Be2 { Un-pinning and preparing to castle } 8... e5 9. O-O Bc5 (9... e4 10. Ne1 { [%cal Gd1d5,Gd1e2] } (10. Nd4 { [%cal Gd4e2,Gd1d5] } 10... Bxe2 (10... Qxd5 11. Bxg4 Qxd4) 11. Nxe2) (10. Bf4 exf3 11. Nxc7+ Ke7 12. Nxa8 (12. gxf3 { [%cal Gf3g4,Gc7a8] }) 12... fxe2 { [%cal Ge2f1,Ge2d1] }) 10... Bxe2 11. Qxe2 Qxd5) 10. Be3 Bxe3 11. Nxe3 { Forcing a queen trade } 11... e4 (11... Bd7 12. Qd5 { [%cal Gf3e5] }) 12. Qxd8+ Rxd8 13. Nxg4 exf3 14. Bxf3 O-O 15. Bxc6 bxc6 { Simplifying the position and ruin black's pawn structure } 16. Rad1 Rxd1 17. Rxd1 h5 18. Ne5 g5 19. Nxc6 Re8 20. Rd8 Kf8 21. Rxe8+ Kxe8 22. Nxa7 f5 23. Kf1 { Black resign } 23... Kd7 24. Ke2 Kd6 25. Kd3 Kd5 26. a4 Kc5 27. Nb5 c6 28. Nc3 Kb4 29. Kd4 { [%csl Ga4][%cal Gb4a5,Gd4e5,Ge5f5,Gf5g5,Gg5h5,Gh2h8] } 29... Ka5 30. Kc4 Kb6 31. b4 { [%cal Ga4a5,Gc4c5] } *


