Striking open the centre for a potential chance to pressure white's queen as it is out in the open. } 6. exd5 Bf5 { [%cal Gd4c2,Gc2e1,Gc2a1] } 7. Qxf5 Nxf5 8. d3 Nxd5 9. Nf3 Bc5 { Black is up a whole queen they don't have to worry about defending every single pawn. Also, if white takes the e5 pawn, it only benefit black by opening the centre. } 10. Nxe5 O-O 11. Nf3?! Re8+ 12. Be3 Nfxe3 13. fxe3 Nxe3! { Preparing a discover check - "The threat is strong than the execution." } 14. Kd2?? { [%cal Gd8d2,Ge3c4] } 14... Nxc4+ { White resign } *


