1. e4 c5 2. Bc4 $15 Nc6 3. a3 e6 { Blunt white's light square bishop and furthermore prepare d5 to occupy the centre with a tempo } 4. Nf3 d5 5. exd5 exd5 { Now white's bishop is just staring at the well defended pawn } 6. Ba2 Nf6 7. O-O Be7 8. Nc3 O-O 9. d3 Bg4 10. h3 Bh5 11. g4 Nxg4?! { (Probably unsound)
Sacrificing to open up the g-file and potentially the h-file if white recapture which exposes white's king to attack. } 12. hxg4 Bxg4 { [%cal Gg4d1] } 13. Bf4 Nd4 14. Kg2? Bxf3+ 15. Qxf3 Nxf3 16. Kxf3 Bg5 { Planning to remove the last defender around the white's king } 17. Nxd5 Bxf4 18. Nxf4 Qf6 { [%cal Gf6f4,Gf6b2] } 19. c3 g5 20. Rg1 Qxf4+ 21. Ke2 { White resign } *


